<title>LATVIA: All yields down at Latvian T-bill sale.</title>
<headline>All yields down at Latvian T-bill sale.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields of all T-bills fell at auction on Wednesday, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV YIELD  LAST WEEK  NO OF BANKS  ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> 28-day     3.94	3.95	   3	    0.75  1.45 0.75</p>
<p> 91-day     4.99	5.17	   5	    1.50  3.3  1.50</p>
<p> 182-day    5.29	5.63	   7	    2.0   5.15 2.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
